Third-party software
--------------------

FleetFlow keeps its dependency list short on purpose. Every entry here is
recorded because the licence requires attribution and because a reader should be
able to see what is depended on, and why. The full licence text of each is in its
module or upstream repository.

github.com/jackc/pgx/v5
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2013-2021 Jack Christensen.
  PostgreSQL driver and connection pool (pgxpool), used by internal/store for the
  fleet records. This is the first non-standard-library dependency in the project.

github.com/jackc/pgpassfile
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2013-2021 Jack Christensen.
  Required indirectly by pgx for ~/.pgpass support.

github.com/jackc/pgservicefile
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2013-2021 Jack Christensen.
  Required indirectly by pgx for pg_service.conf support.

golang.org/x/text
  BSD 3-Clause License. Copyright (c) 2009 The Go Authors.
  Required indirectly by pgx.

