Map data and tiles
------------------

The map uses OpenFreeMap tiles with OpenMapTiles and OpenStreetMap attribution.
OpenStreetMap data is © OpenStreetMap contributors and is made available under
the Open Database License (ODbL). The basemap's attribution control displays the
provider and data credits.
